# Ship only what the app runs on. The Dockerfile copies the whole build
# context, so without this a build from a working checkout also packed the
# local virtualenv, git history, lab datasets and gitignored ops docs into
# the image. Everything is excluded, then the runtime files are let back in;
# a new runtime path has to be added here or it will be missing in the image.
*
!src
!sample_datasets
!requirements.txt
!.streamlit/config.toml
# Read at runtime by the AI Studio's documentation and source tools. Only the
# tracked docs: docs/ also holds local, gitignored ops notes.
!CODEBASE.md
!docs/lipidcruncher_paper.md
!docs/supplementary_methods.md
!tests

**/__pycache__
**/.DS_Store
# Never ship secrets: they come from the environment (ECS secrets) at run time.
**/secrets.toml
**/.env
